stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> free: account created
    free --> pro: checkout.session.completed
    education --> pro: checkout.session.completed
    pro --> free: customer.subscription.deleted
    free --> education: admin grant
    education --> education: admin extend
    education --> free: admin revoke
    education --> free: tier_expires_at passed, read through effective_tier
    note right of pro
        A monthly cap is a 429, never a tier change.
        A failed payment is not a tier change.
    end note
    note right of education
        Counts only while tier_expires_at is in the future.
    end note
